; The local Datom command contract, not a wire Signal.
; Generate reads an ethos file and writes its Rust module into a directory;
; Check reads and validates it whole, writing nothing. A rejection names the
; file, the line and column of the error in it, and the error.
; Inspect (proposal) reads, validates and generates a file, answering with the
; generated Rust; Conform (proposal) reads a file, then a datom text as the
; type it names, answering with the datom's canonical print or its datom error;
; ConformFile reads the datom text from the file its third String names. An
; imported type is read from the sibling .ethos files of the file.
; The files read are of five roots, each section in this order:
;   Library    [ imports ] [ types ] [ traits ] [ associations ]
;   Signal     [ imports ] [ queries ] [ responses ] [ types ] [ traits ] [ associations ]
;   Operation  [ imports ] [ operations ] [ outcomes ] [ types ] [ traits ] [ associations ]   ; proposed
;   Memory     [ imports ] [ record types ] [ traits ] [ associations ]
;   Type       one declaration                               ; proposed
; A file headed Sema is refused as Renamed.Memory. A file is an ordinary datom:
; its root's variant, the dot, then the braced sections (proposal).
; Every type it declares bears a trait (proposal); these bear Sized.
Library.
{
[ datom_codec:[ Error ]
  ethos_zero:[ Problem Location ] ]
[ Query.[ Generate.Generation
          Check.String
          Inspect.String
          Conform.Conformance
          ConformFile.Conformance ]
  Response.[ Generated.Vector<String>
             Checked.String
             Arguments.Integer
             Malformed.Error
             Unreadable.{ String String }
             Rejected.{ String Location Generation_Error }
             Unwritable.{ String String }
             Inspected.{ String String }
             Conformed.{ String String }
             Unconformed.{ String Error } ]
  Generation.{ String String }
  Conformance.{ String String String }
  Generation_Error.[ Structural.protos:Error
                     Conceptual.{ Vector<Integer>
                                  ethos_zero:Problem } ] ]
[]
[ Sized.[ Query Response Generation Conformance Generation_Error ] ] }
